Data
------------------------------------------------------------------------

All vulnerability findings under data/ are synthetic and are dedicated to
the public domain under CC0 1.0. See data/README.md.

Vulnerability enrichment queries the CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities
catalog, the National Vulnerability Database, and EPSS when the cache is
refreshed. Attributed response snapshots are redistributed under data/cache
solely to make the demonstration reproducible; they are not covered by the
synthetic corpus's CC0 dedication and are not offered as an independent work.

